Here is a complete, production-ready **Next.js (App Router)** project structure configured for **Netlify** and **GitHub**.

This project uses **TypeScript** and **Tailwind CSS** (industry standard for modern Next.js apps) and includes specific configurations to ensure smooth deployment on Netlify.

### 1. Project Folder Structure

Create a folder named `my-formula-next` (or your preferred name) and organize the files as follows:

```text
my-formula-next/
├── app/
│   ├── favicon.ico
│   ├── globals.css
│   ├── layout.tsx
│   └── page.tsx
├── components/
│   ├── Footer.tsx
